Brian's probably right. Another possibility is that you've added
another processor to the machine and you don't have enough OSF-BASE or
OSF-USR licenses (one per processor). Run lmf list from the shell and
count them up if they aren't expired, then check how many processors
you have with whatever you like (sysman station, hwmgr, whatever). If
you don't have enough licenses, you can always pull a CPU or call HP to
get them to give you a 30 day trial license(s) until you can buy or
locate an unused one. Hope that helps,

